<title>ESTONIA: MANUFACTURING SALES GROWTH SEEN AT 8 PCT.</title>
<headline>MANUFACTURING SALES GROWTH SEEN AT 8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's manufacturing sales are estimated to grow eight percent in 1997 compared to 1.6 percent the year before, the ministry of economy said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;This is good news as industry is one of the leading economic sectors,&quot; Jaak Leimann, minister of economics, told a news conference.</p>
